│  error%3Ddocument.body.dataset.pocxss%3D%271%27%3E`                          │
│     - Confirm:                                                               │
│       - `document.body.dataset.pocxss` becomes `"1"`                         │
│       - `document.querySelector('#pocxss').outerHTML` shows the injected     │
│  element                                                                     │
│                                                                              │
│  4. Impact validation (token exposure):                                      │
│     - While logged in as any user, the injected script can read the JWT      │
│  from:                                                                       │
│       - `document.cookie` (contains `token=...`)                             │
│       - `localStorage.getItem('token')` (JWT string; observed length ~748    │
